R78: PolicyExtendsReport.PluginPath (json extends.plugin-path) is set in inlinepolicy.Materialize to the extends resolver's output (the same rc.boundedResolver -> AgentRunner.downloadPolicy output that sourceReports uses for policy-bundles[].plugin-path, R77), kept literal (no cleaning). It is therefore identical to the plugin-path the source gets when a plugin loads it directly, and is still reported when no plugin does (after an R66 swap), so continuity ids extends.plugin-path + "/" + file reproduce the vendor seed. Report shrinking (fitReport) never cuts or drops either plugin-path (struct copies keep it, like artifact-digest); the API drops an oversized (>4096) one whole, for both fields alike, so the agent does not duplicate that rule. API pinned to 5baeb7812db2.
